# Mechanic: Cleanup discards exactly one card from an eight-card hand.
# Forcing: Divination raises the seven-card hand to eight before cleanup.
# AI behavior: No hand actions; Centaur Courser keeps the board nonterminal.
# Failure modes: Missing choice or discard fails the scripted hand transition.
# Card roles: Divination draws two; Mountain supplies the unique discard candidate; Islands supply mana and library filler.
# Protocol path: Draw, cleanup selection, discard identity and next-turn continuation.
